{"sections":[{"slug":"切微丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"切微丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">切微丛</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"切微丛"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑流形的切微丛是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/微丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">微丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">是光滑流形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/切丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">切丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种模拟</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的切微丛是</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/微丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">微丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm{pr}_1 \\colon M\\times M \\to M$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}